<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Bonabola · Reporte Meta Ads · Abril 2026</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;700;800&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0a0e1a;
  --surface:#111827;
  --surface-2:#0f1626;
  --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  --accent:#00d4aa;
  --accent2:#ff6b35;
  --accent3:#7c3aed;
  --text:#e8eaf0;
  --muted:#6b7a9a;
  --good:#10b981;
  --warn:#f59e0b;
  --bad:#ef4444;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(14px,1.5vw,16px);line-height:1.6;}

.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(10,14,26,0.85);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px clamp(16px,4vw,48px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;}
.topbar-logo{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(14px,1.8vw,18px);letter-spacing:0.15em;color:var(--text);}
.topbar-badge{background:rgba(0,212,170,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(0,212,170,0.3);color:var(--accent);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:99px;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:0.05em;}

.header{position:relative;padding:clamp(48px,8vw,100px) clamp(16px,6vw,80px) clamp(40px,6vw,72px);overflow:hidden;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
.header::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-120px;right:-80px;width:600px;height:600px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(0,212,170,0.08) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;}
.header::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-80px;left:60px;width:400px;height:400px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(124,58,237,0.06) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;}
.header-eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px;}
.header-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(32px,6vw,72px);line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:16px;}
.header-title span{color:var(--accent);}
.header-sub{font-size:clamp(14px,1.8vw,18px);color:var(--muted);max-width:680px;margin-bottom:40px;}
.header-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:16px;max-width:760px;}
.header-meta-item{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;}
.header-meta-label{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.12em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:4px;}
.header-meta-value{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);}

.section{padding:clamp(40px,6vw,72px) clamp(16px,6vw,80px);}
.section+.section{border-top:1px solid var(--border);}
.section-number{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;}
.section-heading{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(22px,3.5vw,40px);line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:clamp(24px,4vw,48px);}
.subheading{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:20px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:32px;}
.subheading:first-child{margin-top:0;}

.kpi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:16px;margin-bottom:32px;}
.kpi-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-top:3px solid var(--accent-color,var(--accent));border-radius:12px;padding:20px 22px;position:relative;}
.kpi-label{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.12em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;}
.kpi-value{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);line-height:1;margin-bottom:8px;}
.kpi-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);}
.kpi-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:99px;margin-top:6px;}
.badge-good{background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);color:var(--good);}
.badge-warn{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.15);color:var(--warn);}
.badge-bad{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.15);color:var(--bad);}
.badge-info{background:rgba(0,212,170,0.12);color:var(--accent);}

.alert{border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px;border-left:3px solid;}
.alert-good{background:rgba(16,185,129,0.08);border-color:var(--good);color:#a7f3d0;}
.alert-warn{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.08);border-color:var(--warn);color:#fde68a;}
.alert-info{background:rgba(0,212,170,0.08);border-color:var(--accent);color:#a7f3d0;}
.alert-bad{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.08);border-color:var(--bad);color:#fecaca;}
.alert strong{font-weight:700;}

.insight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,212,170,0.06),rgba(124,58,237,0.04));border:1px solid rgba(0,212,170,0.2);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;margin-top:20px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;}
.insight strong{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;}

.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:16px;}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;}
thead{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);}
th{padding:12px 16px;text-align:left;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;}
td{padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);vertical-align:middle;}
tr:hover td{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.025);}
.num{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;}
.num-good{color:var(--good);}
.num-warn{color:var(--warn);}
.num-bad{color:var(--bad);}
.num-accent{color:var(--accent);}
.num-up{color:var(--good);}
.num-down{color:var(--bad);}

.tag{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;letter-spacing:0.05em;}
.tag-broad{background:rgba(0,212,170,0.15);color:var(--accent);}
.tag-padel{background:rgba(124,58,237,0.15);color:#a78bfa;}
.tag-mofu{background:rgba(255,107,53,0.15);color:var(--accent2);}
.tag-tofu{background:rgba(0,212,170,0.15);color:var(--accent);}
.tag-stories{background:rgba(255,107,53,0.15);color:var(--accent2);}
.tag-reels{background:rgba(124,58,237,0.15);color:#a78bfa;}
.tag-feed{background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);color:var(--good);}
.tag-male{background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15);color:#93c5fd;}
.tag-female{background:rgba(236,72,153,0.15);color:#f9a8d4;}
.tag-paused{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.15);color:var(--warn);}

.bar-section{margin-bottom:32px;}
.bar-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.bar-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);width:clamp(80px,14vw,140px);text-align:right;flex-shrink:0;}
.bar-track{flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border-radius:99px;height:28px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.bar-fill{height:100%;border-radius:99px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--bg);}

.ad-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:18px;margin-bottom:24px;}
.ad-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;position:relative;}
.ad-card-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin:8px 0 16px;line-height:1.3;min-height:36px;}
.ad-rank-badge{margin-bottom:8px;}
.ad-rank{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;}
.rank-top{background:rgba(0,212,170,0.15);color:var(--accent);}
.rank-mid{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.15);color:var(--warn);}
.rank-bot{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1);color:var(--bad);}
.ad-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:8px;}
.ad-metric{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;}
.ad-metric-val{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;line-height:1.1;}
.ad-metric-lbl{font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;font-weight:600;}

.video-funnel{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:20px;}
.funnel-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;}
.funnel-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.funnel-label{width:90px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);flex-shrink:0;}
.funnel-bar{flex:1;height:34px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;}
.funnel-fill{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--bg);border-radius:8px;}
.funnel-pct{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;width:60px;text-align:right;color:var(--text);}

.placement-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;}
.placement-name{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.placement-metric{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--border);}
.placement-metric:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.placement-metric-label{color:var(--muted);}
.placement-metric-value{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;}

.persona-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:18px;}
.persona-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:22px;position:relative;border-top:3px solid var(--accent-color,var(--accent));}
.persona-tag{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-color,var(--accent));margin-bottom:6px;}
.persona-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.persona-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;font-style:italic;}
.persona-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.persona-stat{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;}
.persona-stat-lbl{font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:3px;font-weight:600;}
.persona-stat-val{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;}
.persona-desc{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;}

.aes-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,212,170,0.05),rgba(124,58,237,0.04));border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;}
.aes-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:10px;padding:10px 12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.025);border-radius:8px;}
.aes-rank{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--accent);width:32px;flex-shrink:0;}
.aes-seg{flex:1;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;}
.aes-bar{flex:2;height:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;}
.aes-fill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7c3aed);border-radius:99px;}
.aes-baseline{position:absolute;top:-2px;bottom:-2px;width:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);left:0;}
.aes-score{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;width:50px;text-align:right;}

.aes-formula{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 22px;font-family:'DM Sans',monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;}
.aes-formula code{background:rgba(0,212,170,0.1);color:var(--accent);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:600;}

.step-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid;border-radius:12px;padding:20px 24px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.step-card.urgent{border-left-color:var(--bad);}
.step-card.important{border-left-color:var(--warn);}
.step-card.improve{border-left-color:var(--accent3);}
.step-priority{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:99px;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:10px;}
.urgent .step-priority{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.15);color:var(--bad);}
.important .step-priority{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.15);color:var(--warn);}
.improve .step-priority{background:rgba(124,58,237,0.15);color:#a78bfa;}
.step-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px;}
.step-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;}

.conclusion-block p{margin-bottom:18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--text);}
.conclusion-block p strong{color:var(--accent);}

.footer{padding:48px clamp(16px,6vw,80px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border-top:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center;}
.footer-logo{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.2em;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;}
.footer-meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;}
.footer-contact{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;}
.footer-contact a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;}
.footer-contact a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}

@media (max-width:600px){
  .ad-metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  .ad-metric-val{font-size:13px;}
  .bar-label{width:60px;font-size:11px;}
  .funnel-label{width:70px;font-size:11px;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="topbar-logo">B O N A B O L A</div>
  <div class="topbar-badge">Abril 2026 · Meta Ads · España</div>
</div>

<div class="header">
  <div class="header-eyebrow">Navy Marketing · Reporte de rendimiento</div>
  <h1 class="header-title">Meta Ads<br/><span>Abril 2026</span></h1>
  <p class="header-sub">Mes de transición estratégica — escalado del TOFU (Calentamiento de Cuenta) y lanzamiento del primer conjunto MOFU dirigido a la audiencia interesada en pádel hacia conversión. Mercado: España.</p>
  <div class="header-meta">
    <div class="header-meta-item">
      <div class="header-meta-label">Periodo</div>
      <div class="header-meta-value">01 – 30 Abr 2026</div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-meta-item">
      <div class="header-meta-label">Mercado</div>
      <div class="header-meta-value">España 🇪🇸</div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-meta-item">
      <div class="header-meta-label">Moneda</div>
      <div class="header-meta-value">EUR €</div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-meta-item">
      <div class="header-meta-label">Objetivo</div>
      <div class="header-meta-value">TOFU + apertura MOFU</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 01 RESUMEN EJECUTIVO -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-number">01</div>
  <h2 class="section-heading">Resumen Ejecutivo</h2>

  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card" style="--accent-color:var(--accent)">
      <div class="kpi-label">Gasto Total</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">€555,73</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">TOFU €404,54 + MOFU €151,19</div>
      <div class="kpi-badge badge-info">▲ +162% vs marzo</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="--accent-color:var(--accent3)">
      <div class="kpi-label">Impresiones</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">224.298</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Alcance combinado: 151.029 personas</div>
      <div class="kpi-badge badge-good">▲ +127% vs marzo</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="--accent-color:var(--good)">
      <div class="kpi-label">Frecuencia (TOFU)</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">1,53×</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Media ponderada · Calentamiento</div>
      <div class="kpi-badge badge-good">✓ Sin saturación</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="--accent-color:var(--accent2)">
      <div class="kpi-label">CPM medio</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">€2,48</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">TOFU €2,25 · MOFU €3,38</div>
      <div class="kpi-badge badge-warn">▲ +15% vs marzo</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="--accent-color:var(--accent)">
      <div class="kpi-label">Visitas al Perfil de IG</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">12.702</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Solo TOFU · Calentamiento de cuenta</div>
      <div class="kpi-badge badge-good">▲ +87% vs marzo</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="--accent-color:var(--good)">
      <div class="kpi-label">Coste por Visita al Perfil</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">€0,032</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">TOFU · Antes "CPR"</div>
      <div class="kpi-badge badge-good">✓ Estable vs marzo (+3%)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="--accent-color:var(--accent3)">
      <div class="kpi-label">CTR enlace TOFU</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">7,12%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Tasa clic en enlace</div>
      <div class="kpi-badge badge-good">▲ +0,18 pp vs marzo</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="--accent-color:var(--accent2)">
      <div class="kpi-label">Añadidos al Carrito (MOFU)</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">10</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">5 AD4 · 3 AD3 · 1 AD12 · 1 AD5</div>
      <div class="kpi-badge badge-info">Primeros datos · 16 días</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="--accent-color:var(--warn)">
      <div class="kpi-label">Coste por Añadido al Carrito</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">€15,12</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">€151,19 ÷ 10 ATC</div>
      <div class="kpi-badge badge-warn">⚠ Alto · esperable inicio</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="--accent-color:var(--bad)">
      <div class="kpi-label">Compras MOFU</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">0</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">562 clics · 507 LPV · 10 ATC</div>
      <div class="kpi-badge badge-warn">⚠ Falta el último paso</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="alert alert-good"><strong>✓ Lo bueno:</strong> El TOFU pasa la prueba de escala con nota — duplicar el presupuesto solo encarece el Coste por Visita al Perfil un 3% (€0,031 → €0,032), el CTR sube ligeramente al 7,12% y el volumen de visitas al perfil casi se duplica (6.800 → 12.702). El motor de calentamiento funciona y se puede seguir escalando.</div>
  <div class="alert alert-warn"><strong>⚠ Lo que vigilar:</strong> El 15 de abril se lanzó el primer conjunto MOFU (<em>MOFU-Audiencia Paddle</em>) con el objetivo de generar compras desde la audiencia caliente construida en marzo. Ha invertido €151,19 en 16 días, generando 562 clics, 507 LPV y <strong>10 añadidos al carrito (CPATC €15,12)</strong>, pero <strong>0 compras cerradas</strong>. El embudo está moviendo intención de compra, pero falla en el último paso (ATC → Compra). Hay que revisar checkout y métodos de pago en mayo.</div>
  <div class="alert alert-info"><strong>ℹ Nota estructural:</strong> El AdSet TOFU "AUDIENCIA PÁDEL" se reactivó del 1 al 7 de abril (€45,26 invertidos, 1.562 visitas perfil) y se volvió a pausar. A partir del 8 de abril, todo el calentamiento pasó a concentrarse en <strong>AUDIENCIA BROAD</strong> (€359,28 los 30 días). Decisión coherente con la lectura de marzo.</div>
</div>

<!-- 02 DESTINO/PRODUCTO -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-number">02</div>
